OL,3,GNEWSABar to close earlier after
OL,4,A'woman's bed vibrates'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bar must close earlier following
OL,7,Fnoise complaints, with a woman
OL,8,Fdescribing the bass from music as "so
OL,9,Fpowerful" she could "feel the
OL,10,Fvibrations" in her bed.
OL,12,FBridgetown Monroe in Bucklersbury,
OL,13,FHitchin, had previously been able to
OL,14,Fplay music until 02:00 on Friday and
OL,15,FSaturday nights.
OL,17,FBut following several complaints, this
OL,18,Fhas been curtailed to midnight, after
OL,19,FNorth Herts Council's licensing
OL,20,Fcommittee cut its hours.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
